	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Sheet: Daisy Chain SPI\n\nPurpose: Daisy-chain SPI input and output connectors\n\nPlanned contents:\n  - J: S6B-PH-K-S upstream connector (SPI in + power from previous board)\n  - J: S6B-PH-K-S downstream connector (SPI out + power to next board)\n  - ESD protection on every connector signal\n  - Series termination resistors on SPI lines (place near the driving pin)\n  - Pinout must match between boards so any board can follow any other"
